  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EA22 - 2017 Greek Refugee/Migrant and Economic Crisis Recovery Phase</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Goal: To improve living conditions of refugees and migrants currently located in Greece 

Refugees, migrants and vulnerable Greek families meet their family basic needs. Refugees and migrants are facilitated to access Public Healthcare and psychiatric support. Refugees and migrants in camps have access to organized Laundry services. Develop low-cost synergies with existing Caritas Hellas Programs focused in Accommodation and Integration.

Sectors of intervention:
1. Protection / Facilitation of access to Healthcare and Psychiatric support / Synergies with existing programs
2. Material Support / Improvement of living conditions in camps and shelters / Non-Food Items / Food Security and Nutrition (transition out)
3. Water Supply, Sanitation and Hygiene Promotion / small scale interventions / Laundry services in camps</narrative>
  </description>
